        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="take" value="&lt;b&gt;Scopes limit the client, not the user.&lt;/b&gt; A token proves what the app may do in general;&lt;br&gt;only the API knows whether &lt;i&gt;this&lt;/i&gt; object is visible to &lt;i&gt;this&lt;/i&gt; user — step ③ is never optional." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11" vertex="1" parent="1">
